    "chunk_text": "nige gemete blinnan ne mihte, \u00fea w\u00e6s se Godes wer Ac ic \u00fee bidde, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu arise, & wit \u00feonne begen biddan, \u00fe\u00e6t God \u00feysum wife gey\u00fee. Witodlice \u00fea ferdon hi begen to \u00fe\u00e6re neahcyrican & hi sylfe \u00fe\u00e6r samod astrehton to heora & \u00fea \u00fea hi lange hwile hi \u00f0\u00e6r geb\u00e6don, se Godes \u00feeowa b\u00e6d Quadragesimum \u00feone subdeacon, So\u00f0lice gefyldum \u00feam gebede to genam on \u00f0am wife deorwyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s dustes d\u00e6l & dyde to \u00fe\u00e6s & \u00fea he hine lange hwile geb\u00e6d, & swa \u00feeh he nolde na mid \u00f0am subdeacone his gebed gefyllan, & \u00fea for\u00f0on \u00fee he b\u00e6r on his swi\u00f0ran hand \u00fe\u00e6t gesomnode dust, he genam aweg mid his & \u00fea \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t wif geseah \u00fe\u00e6t swa gedon, heo ongan swi\u00f0lice wi\u00f0cwe\u00f0an & wundrian, hw\u00e6t he & he \u00fea onweg adonum \u00feam wrigelse gnad \u00fea on ansyne \u00fe\u00e6s for\u00f0ferdan mannes \u00fe\u00e6t dust. & \u00fea \u00fea he lange hwile gnad, swa se deada man onfeng his sawle & aganode & his eagan \u00dea \u00fea \u00feis \u00fe\u00e6t wif geseah, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r mid swa mycclan heofe gesw\u00e6nced w\u00e6s, heo ongan for \u00f0on \u00dea se drihtnes wer ongan hire styran mid gemetlicre steore & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: swiga, wif, swiga. Ac swa hwylc man swa eow acsige, hu \u00feeos wise gedon w\u00e6re, \u00feonne cwe\u00f0a\u00f0 ge \u00feis an, \u00fe\u00e6t & \u00fea \u00fea he",
